    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mistress Aria's potion shop is booming! She needs your help to make sure she can create, package, and ship the potions on time every night to keep her customers happy. While Mistress Aria researches new potions to sell, you're in charge of restocking the ingredient inventory! Will you exceed her expectations and build a strong relationship with her, or shirk your duties and never experience her jiggle physics?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is presented in 2 distinct stages in every level, the visual novel, and the potion creation mini-game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual Novel Level Features:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Visual Novel elements </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Dating-Sim elements </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A very light narrative </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > First person camera, ability to free roam </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Dialog choices affect your relationship with Mistress Aria, but don't worry - you can always replay the same level </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814180/extras/87cc3e43972c3a7c49e32b18bae0296a.poster.avif?t=1737071239\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814180/extras/87cc3e43972c3a7c49e32b18bae0296a.webm?t=1737071239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814180/extras/87cc3e43972c3a7c49e32b18bae0296a.mp4?t=1737071239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Potion Making Level Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Interactive Potion Creation using the ingredients you purchase and the recipes you unlock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Stock management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > First person camera. No ability to free roam, but ability to pan left and right</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Potion creation performance affects your relationship with Mistress Aria, but don't worry - you can always retry the same level</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814180/extras/7929e55ea8950bce55e660a0501d4310.poster.avif?t=1737071239\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814180/extras/7929e55ea8950bce55e660a0501d4310.webm?t=1737071239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814180/extras/7929e55ea8950bce55e660a0501d4310.mp4?t=1737071239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Once your relationship is high enough with Mistress Aria:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Interactive explicit Sexual Content (interactive via physics controlled with the mouse) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A free roam feature for precise camera placement </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Many unlockable sexy poses and animations to ask Mistress Aria to be in  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814180/extras/a7e4e96daab1f1d79ad1b2afa25e94ad.poster.avif?t=1737071239\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814180/extras/a7e4e96daa